# 📥 Step 1 – Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone <repository-url>
```

### Example

```bash
git clone https://github.com/company/devops-exam-portal.git
```

### What happens?

Git downloads the project to your local machine.

```text
devops-exam-portal/
├── backend/
├── frontend/
├── docker-compose.yml
├── README.md
└── .env.example
```

### Verify the Clone

```bash
cd devops-exam-portal
ls -la
```

Expected output

```text
backend/
frontend/
docker-compose.yml
.env.example
```

